	<element name="Divine Intervention" type="Class Feature" source="System Reference Document 5.1" id="ID_SRD_CLASS_FEATURE_CLERIC_DIVINE_INTERVENTION">
		<description><p>You can use your action to implore your deity for aid. Roll percentile dice: if you roll a number equal to or lower than your cleric level, your deity intervenes. If it does, you can’t use this feature again for 7 days; otherwise you can try again after a long rest. At 20th level your call succeeds automatically.</p></description>
	</element>

