	</element>

	<element name="Supreme Healing" type="Archetype Feature" source="System Reference Document 5.1" id="ID_SRD_ARCHETYPE_FEATURE_LIFE_DOMAIN_SUPREME_HEALING">
		<description><p>When you would normally roll dice to restore hit points with a spell, you instead use the highest number possible for each die.</p></description>
